        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-06-10T03:47:53.512Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh yeah, that wasn’t cruel at all! Mint at 5/0/6/2, AZ down to a Blinding Blast on the last round. 13 cards left on Dawn’s deck, with no Aurora in sight and only 5 Citizens ever played. The only part that got dicey was when Battery got down to 1 HP, and I had to get Tempest to throw him back on top of the deck just to make sure he wouldn’t get burned and flip Dawn.</p>",
